    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped in the dark and mysterious castle of a Fallen Angel, a powerful wizard finds their body and soul torn apart. To escape this cursed place and reclaim their unity, the wizard must face a gauntlet of cunning puzzles set by the very being who divided them. With only a fragile connection between their body and soul, every step demands careful thought and unwavering resolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Pact</strong> is a mind-bending cooperative puzzle adventure inspired by the <i>We Were Here</i> franchise. You and a partner must take on the roles of the wizard's body and soul, each navigating distinct parts of the castle. Communication is your only tool to bridge the gap between your divided perspectives and solve the Fallen Angel\u2019s devious challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you prepared to prove your wits, communication skills, and teamwork in a race against time to reunite the wizard\u2019s essence?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:soulpact@atomnius.com\">soulpact@atomnius.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric thriller experience:</strong> Traverse the shadowy halls of a castle steeped in dread and ancient magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique dual perspectives:</strong> One player commands the wizard\u2019s body, exploring physical realms, while the other controls the soul, uncovering spiritual dimensions of the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate puzzles to solve:</strong> Test your minds and your connection as you uncover clues and solve increasingly complex riddles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive storytelling:</strong> Uncover the dark history of the Fallen Angel and the tragic events that led to your separation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by games like </strong><strong><i>We Were Here</i></strong><strong>, </strong><strong><i>Myst</i></strong><strong>, and the thrill of real-life escape rooms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your courage and choose your partner wisely. Together, you\u2019ll determine if the wizard\u2019s soul and body can forge their <strong>Soul Pact</strong> once more.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Trapped in the dark and mysterious castle of a Fallen Angel, a powerful wizard finds their body and soul torn apart. To escape this cursed place and reclaim their unity, the wizard must face a gauntlet of cunning puzzles set by the very being who divided them. With only a fragile connection between their body and soul, every step demands careful thought and unwavering resolve.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Pact</strong> is a mind-bending cooperative puzzle adventure inspired by the <i>We Were Here</i> franchise. You and a partner must take on the roles of the wizard's body and soul, each navigating distinct parts of the castle. Communication is your only tool to bridge the gap between your divided perspectives and solve the Fallen Angel\u2019s devious challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Are you prepared to prove your wits, communication skills, and teamwork in a race against time to reunite the wizard\u2019s essence?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contact: <a href=\"mailto:soulpact@atomnius.com\">soulpact@atomnius.com</a></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric thriller experience:</strong> Traverse the shadowy halls of a castle steeped in dread and ancient magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique dual perspectives:</strong> One player commands the wizard\u2019s body, exploring physical realms, while the other controls the soul, uncovering spiritual dimensions of the castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intricate puzzles to solve:</strong> Test your minds and your connection as you uncover clues and solve increasingly complex riddles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive storytelling:</strong> Uncover the dark history of the Fallen Angel and the tragic events that led to your separation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by games like </strong><strong><i>We Were Here</i></strong><strong>, </strong><strong><i>Myst</i></strong><strong>, and the thrill of real-life escape rooms.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your courage and choose your partner wisely. Together, you\u2019ll determine if the wizard\u2019s soul and body can forge their <strong>Soul Pact</strong> once more.</p>",
